    "id": 988,
    "date": "2021-09-08T20:29:54+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "New long term campsite above. \n\nThe water is clean, fresh, drinkable for days without consequence.\n\nWhat do I lack?\n\nWhat do I need? \n\nWhat is expendable? \n\nHow much of what we have we don't need. \n\nThose who cry to save the planet. \n\nShow me a better way.\n\nI could live here for years on a bag of dried shrimp and seaweed.  Throw in some spices and other natural odds and ends and I'll be all set.",
    "media": null
  },
