    "id": 991,
    "date": "2021-09-14T17:09:52+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Move a bit further from the stream.  The moving water was loud and so I could not listen to the wind or for animals approaching.   Best not to be too close to the water, yet water is still nearby and available. \n\nNo wifi or cell service here.\n\nPracticing Intermittent Fasting, low carbohydrates and no sugars, high protein eating regime.",
